      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, right margin",
          "value": "\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>After that, when the j\u0101liya collectors</li>\n<li>learned (of it), they said to me: &ldquo;Don&rsquo;t issue</li>\n<li>a rescript, and don&rsquo;t trouble yourself. This man has done</li>\n<li>evil, and if you do anything for him, we will annul it</li>\n<li>by stating that he has means and a house.&rdquo;</li>\n<li>I was taken aback. Then he wrote</li>\n<li>a petition (ruq\u02bfa) about it to the jurist (faq\u012bh) containing</li>\n<li>(a charge of?) murder. Then I owed them</li>\n<li>a deposit. They claimed against me</li>\n<li>that it was a pledge (rahn), and they made me swear</li>\n<li>before the jurist&nbsp;that it was</li>\n<li>a deposit. They claimed that they had</li>\n<li>twenty dirhams owed to them by me.</li>\n<li>The oath was settled, and</li>\n<li>a messenger came out with me and made me forfeit</li>\n<li>six dirhams as the jurist's&nbsp;fee (?)</li>\n<li>charged to me, and the messenger&rsquo;s charged to me. Peace be upon you.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
